"free", "building", "pvp", "questcam", "action"], "long_description": "**Explore an infinite map**\n\nIn Factions, everyone is in a single multiplayer world - shaped entirely by the community. Want to meet up with a friend? Just walk across the map to see them! Building something big? Bring your friends to help you out!!\n\n**Unlimited creativity**\n\nUsing a familiar voxel system, you can build just about anything with a range of block types. Create massive castles, city-scale megabuilds, or small creations from your favorite movie!\n\n**Your favorite locomotion**\n\nFactions matches the best building system with the best movement system. Move around the world by swinging your arms and parkouring off cliffs - its extra fun when you\u2019re deep underground mining!\n\n**Enter a new world**\n\nWhen you join Factions, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly being built and changed by players like you. Even just one person can start something world-changing!\n", "short_description": "Factions is a world built by its players!\n\nBuild whatever you can imagine in an infinite block-based world. Everyone in Factions lives in the same shared multiplayer server that you all shape together - what will your impact be?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://thatswild.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://thatswild.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Wild", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://thatswild.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1725996564472128"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor":